WEBVTT

00:00.670 --> 00:04.270
Let's go on a field trip!

00:04.270 --> 00:06.540
A field trip, you say?

00:06.540 --> 00:10.740
Yes, a lot of strange things 
have been happening lately.

00:10.740 --> 00:12.590
A field trip might be a good idea.

00:13.100 --> 00:18.170
So, Roswaal-sensei, where are we going?

00:18.170 --> 00:21.980
How about a snowy mountain?

00:23.410 --> 00:26.820
A snowy mountain, he says, Capt. Weiss.

00:26.820 --> 00:30.890
To us in the 302nd, it's like our backyard!

00:30.890 --> 00:34.840
All right, let's take an 
opportunity to show them...

00:34.840 --> 00:38.300
...how we train in the Empire!

00:39.020 --> 00:40.860
... is what I said, but...

00:42.260 --> 00:43.480
Why?

00:45.030 --> 00:46.600
Why?

00:49.300 --> 00:51.110
Why did this happen?

00:57.240 --> 01:04.860
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

02:18.530 --> 02:21.980
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

02:21.990 --> 02:27.020
Episode 7: Slip-Sliding! Ski Trip!

02:26.070 --> 02:29.100
Stop it! Stop it, Subaru!

02:29.100 --> 02:33.290
I didn't get to have a snowball fight with 
you during the last snow festival, after all!

02:33.290 --> 02:36.790
Some field trips are actually fun, huh?

02:36.790 --> 02:38.400
Lt. Grantz...

02:38.400 --> 02:40.530
Yes, Capt. Weiss.

02:41.220 --> 02:45.310
Let's have all the fun we 
possibly can on our ski trip!

02:44.360 --> 02:46.140
Weiss! Grantz!

02:46.140 --> 02:48.520
Would you help us dig out an igloo?

02:48.520 --> 02:50.580
Farewell, fun field trip!

02:51.300 --> 02:54.620
That "snowboard" is cute!

02:55.340 --> 02:57.320
Kazuma made it for me!

02:58.490 --> 03:00.840
Visha, we'll leave you behind.

03:01.290 --> 03:05.770
Wait, Albedo-san! I know how 
to ski, but this is different.

03:15.550 --> 03:17.190
Smell ya later!

03:19.580 --> 03:21.130
I won't let her beat me!

03:21.130 --> 03:23.130
Visha, we're going after her!

03:23.740 --> 03:25.410
Okay, I'm ready!

03:29.010 --> 03:31.270
Let's get going, too.

03:31.270 --> 03:32.620
Yes.

03:32.620 --> 03:33.430
Yeah!

03:38.190 --> 03:39.400
I'm cold.

03:39.400 --> 03:42.490
Even when weak from the cold, 
you're still wonderful!

03:42.490 --> 03:47.100
Pathetic. How can such
 a minor chill get to you?

03:47.100 --> 03:49.720
If you're not cold, why not go skiing?

03:49.720 --> 03:52.220
I'd rather not!

03:52.220 --> 03:56.180
Only a mere child could enjoy such a game—

04:01.950 --> 04:02.910
Oh?

04:03.420 --> 04:05.390
I didn't see you there.

04:05.390 --> 04:08.640
ALBEDO!

04:09.690 --> 04:11.220
Ei-yah!

04:11.220 --> 04:12.810
Tei-yah!

04:17.190 --> 04:18.660
Splendid.

04:19.260 --> 04:22.420
Can we go have fun too now?

04:22.420 --> 04:25.440
W-We're not done yet.

04:25.440 --> 04:26.970
Unending digging!

04:27.370 --> 04:30.250
Hey, where's Darkness?

04:30.250 --> 04:33.370
She was just here, playing with some snowballs.

04:35.160 --> 04:37.030
D-Darkness-san?!

04:39.450 --> 04:41.410
Koenig! Neumann!

04:41.410 --> 04:42.320
Right!

04:42.320 --> 04:43.370
On it!

04:43.370 --> 04:44.540
Thanks!

04:46.670 --> 04:49.770
Brother Otto, let's go too!

04:51.180 --> 04:52.290
Me, too?

04:53.540 --> 04:55.100
I'll go, too!

04:56.040 --> 04:57.150
Aqua-san!

05:04.850 --> 05:06.560
We shall go, too.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.110
Okay!

05:07.110 --> 05:08.530
Okay!

05:09.410 --> 05:11.530
So nice and warm.

05:11.530 --> 05:14.760
You deserve to suffer a bit more, Grantz.

05:14.760 --> 05:16.120
Yeah.

05:16.120 --> 05:17.260
Why?

05:19.220 --> 05:21.740
Are you okay, Darkness-san?

05:21.740 --> 05:23.970
Don't mind me!

05:23.970 --> 05:27.410
She seems to be having fun, 
but I don't think that's safe.

05:27.990 --> 05:29.670
Let's bring her to a stop!

05:29.670 --> 05:31.270
How?!

05:31.270 --> 05:34.800
If we can just jump in 
front and push, it'll stop!

05:36.950 --> 05:41.020
Of course it won't!

05:42.270 --> 05:44.030
I'm covered in snow!

05:53.260 --> 05:56.650
Cocytus, thanks for helping!

05:56.650 --> 05:59.780
It was nothing.

06:01.670 --> 06:04.230
Are you all... safe?

06:05.430 --> 06:07.670
Yes. They're all fine.

06:07.670 --> 06:11.640
Do I look fine?!

06:11.980 --> 06:14.210
That was so much fun!

06:14.210 --> 06:17.250
You were the only one having fun, I think.

06:18.260 --> 06:18.990
Oh?

06:22.420 --> 06:25.210
It's getting dark.

06:25.960 --> 06:28.720
It's snowing harder than before.

06:28.720 --> 06:31.780
The weather on a snowy mountain 
changes all the time.

06:31.780 --> 06:34.840
Yeah. Let's head back to the lodge.

06:36.120 --> 06:38.130
What are these?

06:40.340 --> 06:41.790
They're snow sprites.

06:41.790 --> 06:43.420
Snow sprites?

06:43.420 --> 06:48.720
Yes! You can use them to cool your 
fizzy drinks and make them delicious!

06:55.670 --> 06:58.580
Thin-faced man!

06:58.580 --> 07:00.260
"Thin-faced"?

07:00.260 --> 07:02.480
What's wrong, Aqua-san?

07:02.990 --> 07:04.410
Lady Lalatina?!

07:04.410 --> 07:06.020
Don't call me that!

07:06.540 --> 07:07.590
No...

07:07.590 --> 07:09.030
We're doomed!

07:09.030 --> 07:10.690
Why are we doomed?

07:10.690 --> 07:12.870
If you bully the snow sprites,

07:12.870 --> 07:14.130
it will...

07:14.130 --> 07:15.360
It will...?

07:15.360 --> 07:17.240
It will come!

07:18.260 --> 07:19.930
What's "it"?

07:24.860 --> 07:26.340
What's that?

07:27.090 --> 07:29.670
That's the Winter Shogun!

07:29.670 --> 07:31.940
The Winter Shogun?

07:31.940 --> 07:35.510
Yes, it's a specially-designated 
monster in our world.

07:35.510 --> 07:38.970
A greater spirit that appears 
in freezing cold winters!

07:38.970 --> 07:41.590
Also, kids love it!

07:41.590 --> 07:43.210
That's a lot of exposition.

07:44.300 --> 07:45.780
A greater spirit...

07:45.780 --> 07:47.520
Seems tough.

07:47.520 --> 07:52.130
So, how strong is this Winter Shogun?

07:52.130 --> 07:55.790
It will cut off your head before you 
can even get a sense of its strength.

07:56.380 --> 07:58.850
That's really bad!

07:59.300 --> 08:00.660
It's fine!

08:00.660 --> 08:03.360
If you get on your knees,
it won't see you as an enemy,

08:03.360 --> 08:04.920
and just pass you by!

08:04.920 --> 08:09.140
Kazuma-san forgot to get rid of his sword, 
so he got his head cut off, though.

08:09.140 --> 08:10.390
His head got cut off?!

08:12.130 --> 08:16.010
Then we can't just stand here!

08:16.010 --> 08:19.340
The Winter Shogun's getting closer and closer!

08:19.340 --> 08:20.720
That's right!

08:20.720 --> 08:22.620
Everybody, throw down your weapons!

08:22.620 --> 08:25.100
Get rid of them.

08:25.100 --> 08:26.730
And kneel!

08:26.730 --> 08:31.550
Hey, Cocytus! Why are you 
still holding your weapon?

08:29.630 --> 08:33.800
This weapon was given to me by my creator.

08:33.800 --> 08:35.740
I will never abandon it.

08:35.740 --> 08:41.140
Do you understand you're putting us all at risk?

08:41.550 --> 08:43.910
I won't kneel either.

08:43.910 --> 08:45.290
I'm with you.

08:45.290 --> 08:49.080
I think you could go along 
with the group, Garfiel!

09:03.380 --> 09:05.660
Hey, Winter Shogun.

09:06.480 --> 09:10.240
Could you let them go, please?

09:10.240 --> 09:11.050
It's hopeless!

09:11.050 --> 09:13.020
The Winter Shogun is a greater spirit!

09:13.020 --> 09:17.780
Only another greater spirit or a 
goddess like me can talk to him!

09:17.780 --> 09:20.230
I'm a greater spirit, actually.

09:20.230 --> 09:22.150
You are?

09:22.150 --> 09:23.450
That's kind of amazing!

09:24.520 --> 09:25.880
Winter...

09:26.590 --> 09:30.290
Yes, I know what you want to say.

09:33.590 --> 09:35.210
Winter...

09:35.210 --> 09:36.250
Yes.

09:36.250 --> 09:38.550
We love winter, too.

09:38.550 --> 09:40.010
Winter...

09:40.010 --> 09:41.300
It's fine.

09:41.300 --> 09:45.070
We'll protect winter in our own way.

09:45.070 --> 09:46.730
Winter...

09:46.730 --> 09:47.730
Yes.

09:48.100 --> 09:50.540
Why can Otto talk to him?

09:50.940 --> 09:53.100
Hey, why?

09:53.100 --> 09:54.710
Winter...

09:55.160 --> 09:57.540
He left.

09:57.540 --> 10:00.290
Their hearts connected, huh?

10:04.920 --> 10:07.670
What incredible bloodlust.

10:10.070 --> 10:12.140
I was so scared!

10:12.140 --> 10:13.950
Splendidly done.

10:13.950 --> 10:18.060
What did the Winter Shogun 
say at the end, Brother Otto?

10:18.060 --> 10:23.660
Um, he looked at Cocytus-san and said he'd 
let the other Winter Shogun take care of it.

10:23.660 --> 10:26.880
Are you a Winter Shogun, too?

10:26.880 --> 10:28.730
No, I'm not.

10:28.730 --> 10:32.870
Sheesh. There's no telling what 
will happen when the worlds mix.

10:32.870 --> 10:33.810
Yeah.

10:33.810 --> 10:36.790
Darkness-san, how did you get 
stuck in the snowball anyway?

10:36.790 --> 10:40.060
Actually, Subaru and the others...

10:44.630 --> 10:46.340
It's so peaceful.

10:46.340 --> 10:50.810
Yes. Very different from the 
tension of the last few days.

10:50.810 --> 10:55.150
It's a nice change of pace, right?

10:56.280 --> 10:59.320
There you are, Mr. #1 on 
the Suspicious Leaderboard.

10:59.750 --> 11:03.190
How cruel.

11:03.190 --> 11:08.730
I'm here to help you have a fun school life.

11:08.730 --> 11:12.850
The way you say it makes it suspicious. Sheesh.

11:12.850 --> 11:16.590
Well, well, I'm sorry.

11:17.140 --> 11:20.260
A fun school life, huh?

11:22.950 --> 11:24.030
Yes.

11:24.030 --> 11:26.110
This is kind of nice.

11:26.830 --> 11:27.570
Yeah.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.190
Yup.

11:33.060 --> 11:35.660
It's not stopping!

11:35.660 --> 11:39.980
Subaru, can't you move?!

11:39.980 --> 11:43.010
Even though I can't move,
you're still very pretty!

11:43.010 --> 11:45.350
I sure am!

11:49.030 --> 11:53.620
Looking at that, it feels
 stupid to be serious.

11:54.440 --> 12:01.040
So let's enjoy our weird school 
life, like we always do.

12:01.040 --> 12:02.310
Indeed.
